# Static Snare: "for each attacking creature" (CR 506.4): an attacker that has died is no longer attacking. Bot2 attacks with two
# Ornithopters on turn 4; Bot1 kills one with a Lightning Bolt, so only one still attacks and the Snare costs {3}{W}: four Mox Pearls
# pay it exactly and nothing floats (had the dead one counted, a mana would be left over).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Static Snare
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x20

