Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter#1; Ornithopter#2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
